  "limitations": [
    "Zero on-shift orders (914 test orders, 1.8%): MAE 15.0 min, bias -7.0 min, P90 coverage 84.0%. The zero_onshift flag was dropped by the pre-registered ablation and not revisited after the test week.",
    "Stores unseen in train (768 test orders, 1.5%): MAE 12.0 min, bias -5.4 min.",
    "Level shift: test-week median 45.3 min vs 43.9 in train; every model under-predicts (P50 bias -3.1 min).",
    "Intervals are raw: test-week P10 coverage 9.1% (nominal 10), P90 88.2% (nominal 90), 80% interval 79.1% (nominal 80), mean width 30.6 min.",
    "Three weeks of one early-2015 snapshot: no seasonality, weather or traffic information.",
    "Weekday effects rest on three dates per weekday; Feb 1 (Super Bowl Sunday) is one of three train Sundays."
  ],
  "decisions": [
    "Validation: two forward 7-day folds; store_target_enc recomputed inside each fold (leave-one-day-out).",
    "Target scale: raw seconds (raw vs log1p tied on validation).",
    "Point model: L1, 300 rounds, lr 0.05, 31 leaves, min_child_samples 100, bagging 0.8/0.8; no tuning.",
    "Features: one-at-a-time swaps judged against a 3-seed noise floor and per-day paired plots; only zero_onshift was dropped.",
    "Quantile rounds: smallest round within the seed spread of the pinball minimum in both folds.",
    "No calibration of intervals; raw coverage reported.",
    "Single fixed seed (42) for the final models; test week evaluated once."
  ],
